{"product_id":"bleedout","title":"Bleedout","description":"\u003cp\u003eHugh Freyl is a blind lawyer, scion of Illinois' most influential family. He recounts this story from the grave. David Marion is Freyl's protege and a young convicted killer whose release from prison Freyl has orchestrated. He now stands accused of Freyl's murder and none of Freyl's inner circle will attest otherwise.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 155 x 240\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Joan Brady\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780743268417\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 400\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45748964982937,"sku":"16RC-19780743268417","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d665939b868_Bleedout_Joan_Brady.jpg?v=1758895744","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/bleedout","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}